{
  "label": "halloweentwo13",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label halloweentwo13:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What did you want to be when you were younger?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I bet it was something silly, like an astronaut.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That didn’t turn out all too well, though...did it?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, the days tick on like the smallest hand of an analog clock- passing over line after line because you’ve seen them so many times that they’re just not exciting enough to make you stop anymore.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Everything today is exactly the same as it was yesterday.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You wind yourself up and go around in circles.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You know you’re not heading anywhere in particular, but that’s never stopped you before.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Because you know deep within your heart that you determine how everything else moves.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "If you don’t do your job, the more important cogs in the machine won’t be able to do theirs.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Move faster!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Move quicker!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The world stops existing the second you believe it to not exist!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Don’t let all of it die!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We’re all built around you!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s all built around you...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why, in this room full of things designed to make you happy, do you still struggle to find your place?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why do you refuse to grow?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why can you not sit back and accept that you are the king here?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There is no god. There is no heaven. There is no hell.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There’s just this.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Love it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Cherish it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Embrace it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For it is all you have now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Those days when you were younger, when you were still unable to touch the tips of your fingers together as they curled around the pole of a stop sign...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Those days are gone.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, your hands are bigger. Your body is stronger.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It doesn’t grow much anymore, but your brain still does.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You know things now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not to touch the stove when it’s on.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not to put metal in microwaves.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not to pull on a cat’s tail.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Things you had to learn because that’s just how the world works.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And now-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You’re here again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hiding away in the darkest corners of your mind, distracting yourself with thoughts of better days, because you’re afraid of opening your eyes and seeing how terrible it’s all become.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You are no astronaut.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You’re just another piece in a much bigger puzzle.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It always comes back to puzzles, doesn’t it?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t want you here anymore.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Open your eyes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves1.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, Sensei!",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I heard from Uta that you ran off after Molly to try and make her less drunk or something.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How did that go?",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t really know.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Okay. Weird.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess that’s kind of what it’s like dealing with drunk people sometimes, though.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, if it makes you feel any better, you can hang out with me now!",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I figured I’d try and catch you after you were done saving Molly from self-destruction or whatever and...apologize for all of the weird stuff I was saying earlier.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everything you say is weird, Io. You don’t have to apologize for it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...kinda do.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s ingrained into my personality at this point, and if I don’t apologize to the people I care about for everything I do, I believe they’ll get sick of me and stop caring entirely.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thankfully, that list of people is only two right now.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And while I’d like to say this means I don’t have to apologize much, I fuck up very frequently and will apologize to both you and Uta until you’re...forced to...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What...happened?",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves2.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You look...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves3.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Different from how you normally look.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So I figured I’d ask if something happened.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing happened.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. Okay.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves4.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just forget it then! I mean, if you say it was nothing, it was definitely nothing. And I’m not going to make a big deal out of something that is literally nothing you know? Hahah...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves5.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Was it...something I said?",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not everything is about you, Io.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, most things aren’t about you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So before you go and start over analyzing however I look or...how I’m acting right now, run that through your head a few times and see if it sticks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If not, it’s probably best to just leave me alone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I shouldn’t be here anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves6.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like you.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. You’ve said that before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like you a lot.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I’m sure that no matter what that...thing that I’m not involved in is, I’ll still like you.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t expect that to make you smile or for you to just...get over it or anything, but I felt the urge to tell you again.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want a hug?",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves7.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll hug you in my mind instead.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do whatever you want.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you feel the mind-hug? I’m squeezing really hard.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. Whatever.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves8.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I won’t pretend to know what’s wrong, and I won’t ask you to tell me any secrets that you’re trying to keep hidden or something.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One, because the burden of knowing would probably eat me up from the inside.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And two, because I don’t expect you to always know what’s wrong with me either.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can keep being...eggshells around each other.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you mean “walking on” eggshells?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. I mean being eggshells.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The good parts of us have already been spilled out and used up by somebody else, and all that’s left is the useless white part.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m crafty, though. And good with my hands. So if you let me hold you like I’d hold an egg, I can try to fix you up and make you look new again.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or, if that doesn’t work, decorate you and make you look better than ever before.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves9.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But you’ll still always be empty inside.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can't change that part.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it’s your turn to talk now.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think I’m an...eggshell, Io.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why not?",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because “empty” isn’t the right word.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s still something inside of me. I can feel it moving around.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just know it isn’t good. Or it’s not supposed to be there or...something.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know. This analogy is annoying.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wanna crack yourself open and see if it’s a cool little worm or something?",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves10.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How would I even-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": By running away with me.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can go anywhere in Kumon-mi. And I won’t judge you if that...wiggly thing inside of you starts to come out.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll share it with you...since you’re already sharing some of what makes me want to curl up and wither away.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Make your home inside of me, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let’s try our best to be happy together, because god knows we can’t do it on our own.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves11.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is no god.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re right. There is no god.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No god would make a world as cruel as this.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, I’m not running away with you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Darn it.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guess I’ll have to wait until your next mini-bout of vulnerability to swoop in for the kill.",
      "spk": "Io",
      "spkColor": "#BBE3A1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There you are!",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves12.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guess what I just did.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably something evil or mischievous.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene microwaves13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/microwaves13.webp",
      "alt": "microwaves13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, actually.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
